                <h3>1. Academic Integrity & Originality</h3>
                <p>
                    Contributors must guarantee that submitted manuscripts represent entirely <strong>original research</strong> that has not been previously published or concurrently submitted elsewhere.
                </p>
                <ul class="publish-check-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <strong>Zero Plagiarism Tolerance:</strong> All quotes, data, and paraphrased arguments must be thoroughly cited.</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <strong>Citation Standards:</strong> Use accepted citation formats (OSCOLA, Bluebook, or Chicago Manual).</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Read our full <a href="/legal/academic-integrity/">Statement of Academic Integrity</a>.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Condition 2: Subject Scope -->
