                <p>
                    SecuLex prioritizes critical analysis, comparative inquiry, and practical commentary across our core legal and strategic pillars:
                </p>
                <ul class="publish-check-list">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <strong>Cyber & Tech Regulation:</strong> Cybercrime, AI governance, digital evidence, data privacy.</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <strong>International & Public Law:</strong> State responsibility, human rights, global governance.</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <strong>Specialized Legal Disciplines:</strong> Medical Law, Forensic Law, PhD Thesis abstracts.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

