        <!-- Manuscript Formatting Guidelines -->
        <div class="publish-guidelines-box fade-in">
            <div class="guidelines-header">
                <div class="guidelines-icon"><i class="fas fa-scroll"></i></div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Manuscript Formatting & Requirements</h3>
                    <p>Ensure your document meets the following criteria prior to sending:</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="guidelines-grid">
                <div class="guidelines-item">
                    <span class="guidelines-number">01</span>
                    <h4>Word Count</h4>
                    <p><strong>Short Commentary:</strong> 1,500 – 3,000 words.<br><strong>Full Scholarly Article:</strong> 3,000 – 8,000 words.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="guidelines-item">
                    <span class="guidelines-number">02</span>
                    <h4>Abstract & Keywords</h4>
                    <p>Include a concise <strong>Abstract (150–250 words)</strong> summarizing research questions, methodology, findings, and 4–6 key search terms.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="guidelines-item">
                    <span class="guidelines-number">03</span>
                    <h4>Author Biography</h4>
                    <p>Provide a 2–4 sentence professional bio, academic affiliation, official title, and optional high-resolution portrait photo.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="guidelines-item">
                    <span class="guidelines-number">04</span>
                    <h4>File Formats</h4>
                    <p>Submit documents in editable <strong>Microsoft Word (.docx)</strong> format. Accompanying tables or diagrams must be vector or high-res PNG.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

